            "line": 791,
            "text": "theorem physical_scale_identity {Q q : ℝ} (hQ : 0 < Q) (hq : 0 < q) (h : ℝ) :\n    (Q ^ (-velocityExponent h)) ^ 2 * Q ^ h *\n      (Q / q) ^ (velocityExponent h + 1 / 2) = q ^ (-velocityExponent h - 1 / 2)"
